  "title": "RunCN #第20站｜哈尔滨马拉松：那年，我在东北老家跑哈马",
  "ready": false,
  "images": 59,
  "slug": "harbin-marathon",
  "intro": "因为 check 多跑了一次哈马。松花江、黑土地、老家和疫情前那些快活的流浪日子，都在这篇里。",
  "map": "/assets/runcn-article-maps-20261022/harbin-marathon.jpg",
  "poster": "../../assets/cover-medal-harbin-marathon.jpg?v=20260628-runcn-harbin-confident-v1",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 15px; padding: 8px 11px; line-height: 1.65; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; color: #b7791f; background: #f4f8fb; border-left: 3px solid #d4a669; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', 'PingFang SC', serif; font-style: italic;\">那年，我在东北老家跑哈马</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 15px; padding: 8px 11px; line-height: 1.65; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; color: #b7791f; background: #f4f8fb; border-left: 3px solid #d4a669; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', 'PingFang SC', serif; font-style: italic;\">黑土地，有温度</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">去年因为check，让我有机会多跑了一次哈马。一直没心情去记录，特别是错过了刚跑完的那股热乎劲儿，就更不想写了。就是觉得炒冷饭硌牙，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\" style=\"color:#237953;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #237953;padding-bottom:2px;\">我牙还不好</strong>，一上火就疼。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">病毒悄么的过来以后，聚众跑步是别想了，所以有时候会特别怀念那些到处流浪的日子。怎么跟你形容呢？那是一种刺挠儿的感觉，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"2\" style=\"color:#306eaa;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #306eaa;padding-bottom:2px;\">简单说就是</strong>，快活啊。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">翻翻手机里的老照片老视频，库存还真挺多的。疫情里总给自己做工作，手机空间可不多了，再不整理，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"3\" style=\"color:#9a681c;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">可就要爆炸了</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Harbin-Marathon-clean_files/img-001.webp",
      "caption": "东北，老家 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "黑龙江哈尔滨故事照片 1"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">梳理梳理旧时光，放放老照片。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "回家"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">我家离哈尔滨市区几十公里，适合养老。毕业两个多月了，大多数同学都入职了，好像都挺开心的。<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\" style=\"color:#ac4336;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">我快成无业游民了</strong>，贸易战这会又谈崩了，小人物在大时代的背景下，深深叹息。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Harbin-Marathon-clean_files/img-002.webp",
      "caption": "小城兴隆 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "黑龙江哈尔滨故事照片 2"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Harbin-Marathon-clean_files/img-003.webp",
      "caption": "小城兴隆 · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "黑龙江哈尔滨故事照片 3"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\" style=\"color:#237953;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #237953;padding-bottom:2px;\">我在家里过起了养老生活</strong>，白天放放飞机，晚上看看广场舞，没事领着爷爷奶奶遛遛弯，累了躺着睡觉王者荣耀。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Harbin-Marathon-clean_files/img-004.webp",
      "caption": "小城商城 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "黑龙江哈尔滨故事照片 4"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Harbin-Marathon-clean_files/img-005.webp",
      "caption": "黄昏下的图书馆和广场 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "黑龙江哈尔滨故事照片 5"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Harbin-Marathon-clean_files/img-006.webp",
      "caption": "黄昏变晚霞的小城天空 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "黑龙江哈尔滨故事照片 6"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">原本没报希望的哈马，就这样能跑了，也没训练，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"2\" style=\"color:#306eaa;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">硬着头皮去吧</strong>，冲冲喜。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">之前一直想通过一次哈马，把哈尔滨的地标都走走，然后写个大作。因为大背景不好，导致行动力不足，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\" style=\"color:#9a681c;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #9a681c;padding-bottom:2px;\">也就走哪算哪了</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Harbin-Marathon-clean_files/img-007.webp",
      "caption": "哈尔滨道外清真寺 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "黑龙江哈尔滨故事照片 7"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Harbin-Marathon-clean_files/img-008.webp",
      "caption": "音乐之都哈尔滨 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "黑龙江哈尔滨故事照片 8"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">人多的地儿，比如哈尔滨的地标索菲娅教堂，中央大街，人民英雄纪念碑，航拍心理压力太大，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"0\" style=\"color:#ac4336;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #ac4336;padding-bottom:2px;\">而且也去了太多次了</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Harbin-Marathon-clean_files/img-009.webp",
      "caption": "防洪纪念塔@2018 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "黑龙江哈尔滨故事照片 9"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Harbin-Marathon-clean_files/img-010.webp",
      "caption": "索菲亚大教堂@2017 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "黑龙江哈尔滨故事照片 10"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"1\" style=\"color:#237953;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">哈尔滨大剧院边的湿地公园</strong>人烟稀少，黑飞不会被抓，再有就是大剧院真的太美了，简直是外星文明，非常值得探索。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Harbin-Marathon-clean_files/img-011.webp",
      "caption": "哈尔滨大剧院湿地公园 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "黑龙江哈尔滨故事照片 11"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Harbin-Marathon-clean_files/img-012.webp",
      "caption": "哈尔滨大剧院湿地公园 · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "黑龙江哈尔滨故事照片 12"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Harbin-Marathon-clean_files/img-013.webp",
      "caption": "哈尔滨大剧院湿地公园 · 3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "黑龙江哈尔滨故事照片 13"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">黄昏前坐公交到湿地公园，飞机视角下的大剧院很科幻，有一种悉尼歌剧院的感觉，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"2\" style=\"color:#306eaa;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">这里也被称为“凝固音乐的演奏者”</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Harbin-Marathon-clean_files/img-014.webp",
      "caption": "哈尔滨大剧院 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "黑龙江哈尔滨故事照片 14"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">黑格尔说过，“音乐是流动的建筑，建筑是凝固的音乐”，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\" style=\"color:#9a681c;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #9a681c;padding-bottom:2px;\">而我大哈尔滨又被称为“音乐之都”</strong>，非常好的诠释。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Harbin-Marathon-clean_files/img-015.webp",
      "caption": "航拍哈尔滨大剧院 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "黑龙江哈尔滨故事照片 15"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Harbin-Marathon-clean_files/img-016.webp",
      "caption": "航拍哈尔滨大剧院 · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "黑龙江哈尔滨故事照片 16"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">等到天色渐暗，湿地倒映的天空让我想到了大理的天空之镜，落日余晖下的城市很漂亮，也会遗憾，没有记录这座城市更多的细节。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Harbin-Marathon-clean_files/img-017.webp",
      "caption": "航拍哈尔滨大剧院 · 3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "黑龙江哈尔滨故事照片 17"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Harbin-Marathon-clean_files/img-018.webp",
      "caption": "",
      "alt": "黑龙江哈尔滨故事照片 18"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">真正的惊喜是入夜后的大剧院，她就像这座城市心中的一团火，冰冷的外边下，是火热的灵魂。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">匆匆别了这里，作为一个东北人，我始终觉得还有时间去慢慢探索这座城市。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Harbin-Marathon-clean_files/img-019.webp",
      "caption": "记忆中的冰雪大世界@2019 @Arsenan",
